Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:52:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] W1-02 ChunkPos: packed-long key benchmark

Stage 3 of W1-02 (ChunkPos). Compares per-step coordinate-object keys,
boxed Long keys, and packed-long keys with a minimal open-addressed map;
packed keys eliminate object creation entirely and are the recommended
migration shape for ticket/chunk-map collections.
